<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Sept PPI rises 2.3 pct on the year.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Sept PPI rises 2.3 pct on the year.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's producer price index (PPI) rose 2.3 percent in September on the year, down from a 5.2 percent year-on-year rise a year earlier, Ministry of Finance and Economy figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>					   Sept     Aug     Sept 96</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, yr-on-yr)	    +2.3     +2.3	+5.2</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, month-to-month)    +0.4     +0.1	+0.4</p>
<p>    PPI (base=1990)		 120.9    120.4     118.2</p>
<p>The ministry said the producer price index (PPI) rose 3.0 percent for the nine months of 1996 against a 4.1 percent rise a year earlier.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5647</p>
